                                "sense_id": "6e1ebff1-9606-3c30-b55a-a8fb66337648",
                                "text": "By the time this mysterious knight died in the 1360s, his book was available in every European language, including Dutch, Gaelic, Czech, Catalan, and Walloon."
                            },
